":"ஈ","gloss":"give"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"giving"},{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"மாரி","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain"},{"surface":"வண்","parts":[{"text":"வண்","lemma":"வண்","gloss":"generous"}],"gloss":"generous","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கை","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"}],"gloss":"hand"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடும்பகட்","parts":[{"text":"கடும்பகட்","lemma":"கடும்பகட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டியானை","parts":[{"text":"டியானை","lemma":"டியானை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெடுந்தே","parts":[{"text":"நெடுந்தே","lemma":"நெடுந்தே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ரஞ்சி","parts":[{"text":"ரஞ்சி","lemma":"ரஞ்சி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கொன்","parts":[{"text":"கொன்","lemma":"கொன்","gloss":"fearful"}],"gloss":"fearful"},{"surface":"முனை","parts":[{"text":"முனை","lemma":"முனை","gloss":"frontier"}],"gloss":"frontier"},{"surface":"இரவு","parts":[{"text":"இரவு","lemma":"இரவு","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"night"},{"surface":"ஊர்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"}],"gloss":"town"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சில","parts":[{"text":"சில","lemma":"சில","gloss":"few"}],"gloss":"few"},{"surface":"ஆகுக","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"க","lemma":"க","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"let them become"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"துஞ்சும்","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சு","lemma":"துஞ்சு","gloss":"sleep"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"sleeping"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"days"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"days"}]}],"literal":"Tangled creeper rattan's striped back ripe fruit / deep water pond's carp fish seizes / cool shore town's man's wife you if you are / many let them become your heart's afflictions / ceaselessly giving rain-like generous hand / fierce male elephant tall chariot Anji's / fearful frontier night town like / few let them become you sleeping days.","translation":"If you are indeed the woman of the lord of the cool shore, where the carp fish in the deep pond seize the ripe, striped-backed fruits of the tangled rattan creepers, may the afflictions in your heart be many! And like the fearful frontier town at night belonging to chieftain Anji, who has a generous hand like the ceaseless rain, fierce male elephants, and tall chariots, may the days you sleep in peace be very few!","modern":"பின்னிக்கிடக்கும் கொடிகளையுடைய பிரம்பின் வரி போன்ற முதுகைக் கொண்ட பழுத்த பழத்தை, ஆழமான நீர்நிலை உடைய குளத்தில் உள்ள கெண்டை மீன்கள் கவ்வி உண்ணும் குளிர்ந்த துறையை உடைய ஊரனுக்கு நீ மனைவியாக இருந்தால், உன் நெஞ்சில் உள்ள துன்பங்கள் பலவாக ஆகட்டும்! ஓயாமல் பொழியும் மழையைப் போன்ற கொடைத் தன்மையுடைய கைகளையும், கடிய ஆண் யானைகளையும், நெடிய தேரையும் உடைய அஞ்சியினது அச்சம் தரும் போர்க்களத்து எல்லையில் உள்ள இரவு நேரத்து ஊரைப் போல, நீ நிம்மதியாகத் தூங்கும் நாட்கள் மிகச் சிலவாக ஆகட்டும்!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine (Thalaivi) to the courtesan (Parathai) who has taken the hero's affection. She sarcastically tells the courtesan that if she considers herself the hero's true woman, she will only inherit endless anxiety and sleepless nights. The poem belongs to the Marutam (agricultural) landscape, which is characterized by infidelity and sulking. The image of the carp fish in the deep pond seizing the ripe rattan fruit represents the courtesan seizing the hero, who belongs to the fertile town. The comparison to the frontier town of chieftain Anji, which is constantly under threat of attack at night, vividly conveys the sleepless anxiety the courtesan will suffer due to the hero's unfaithful nature.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,3.77],[3.77,4.14],[4.14,4.31],[4.31,4.8],[4.8,5.21],[5.21,5.51],[5.51,5.92],[5.92,6.7],[6.7,7.48],[7.48,7.7],[7.7,8.5],[8.5,8.7],[8.7,9.6],[9.6,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,11.2],[11.2,12.2],[12.2,12.4],[12.4,12.9],[12.9,13.4],[13.4,14.18],[14.31,14.7],[14.7,15.3],[15.3,15.84],[16.2,16.32],[16.44,16.8],[17.04,17.28]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.99],[1.99,2.54],[2.54,3.09],[3.09,3.78],[3.78,4.19],[4.19,4.74],[4.74,5.29],[5.29,5.61],[5.61,6.03],[6.03,6.35],[6.35,6.67],[6.67,6.9],[6.9,9.3],[9.3,9.5],[9.5,10.34],[10.34,10.96],[11.0,11.3],[11.3,12.1],[12.1,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.4],[14.4,15.1],[15.1,15.82],[15.94,16.3],[16.3,17.0],[17.0,18.0],[18.0,18.34],[18.34,18.67],[18.67,18.9]]},"sync":[[["அரில்","tangled"],["பவர்","creeper"]],[["பிரம்பின்","of rattan"]],[["வரி","striped"],["புற","back"]],[["விளை","ripe"],["கனி","fruit"]],[["குண்டு","deep"],["நீர்","water"]],[["நீர்","water"],["இலஞ்சி","pond"]],[["கெண்டை","carp fish"]],[["கதூஉம்","seizes"]],[["தண்","cool"],["துறை","ghat"]],[["ஊரன்","man of the town"]],[["பெண்டினை","if you are his woman"]],[["ஆயின்","if"]],[["பல","many"]],[["ஆகுக","let them become"],["நின்","your"]],[["நெஞ்சின்","in heart"]],[["படரே","afflictions"]],[["ஓவாது","ceaselessly"]],[["ஓவாது","ceaselessly"],["ஈயும்","giving"]],[["மாரி","rain"]],[["வண்","generous"],["கை","hand"]],[["கடும்பகட்",""]],[["டியானை",""]],[["நெடுந்தே",""]],[["ரஞ்சி",""]],[["கொன்","fearful"],["முனை","frontier"]],[["இரவு","night"],["ஊர்","town"]],[["போல","like"]],[["சில","few"]],[["ஆகுக","let them become"],["நீ","you"]],[["துஞ்சும்","sleeping"]],[["நாளே","days"]]]}